  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Striking with this weapon feels like a catastrophic rupture in the physical world, as if the blow itself devours the life of the target. Its jagged edges bite deep, leaving behind a lingering, corrosive rot. This relic of the Gate of the Dead carries a malice that stains the very air around it."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Corroded iron plates are bound together with blackened wire, leaving a jagged, pitted surface. The handle remains slick with a persistent, oily grime that stains the palm."
    }
  },
